{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version you will be able to familiarize yourself with the first location, an ancient abandoned castle-laboratory of acultists. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A real boomer-shooter - old-school gameplay in the spirit of DOOM II, Duke Nukem and Quake. No cover, no reloading. It's just you and your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cult tech - an arsenal ranging from axes and archaic shotguns to and damn futuristic cannons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grimdark universe - inspired by Eastern Slavic myths, Varangian culture, and crazy techno-cult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grim enemies - from cultists, stormtroopers, magi, to cybernatchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grim locations - Forgotten kapis, industrial necropolises, ancient citadels and throne rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soundtrack - Classic heavy metal mixed with industrial music </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667830?t=1745757070","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667830?t=1745757070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667830/b618149775503b669d6d47fa7a7033dd3c93dec6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745757070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667830/b618149775503b669d6d47fa7a7033dd3c93dec6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745757070","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"What should customers know about the Mature Content in your game"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version you will be able to familiarize yourself with the first location, an ancient abandoned castle-laboratory of acultists. </p><ul